:''Not to be confused with [[Ms. Sign]] or [[Angel Fanboy]].''
'''Aku Researcher''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]] and can be unlocked at a 30% chance when clearing [[Wrath of Hell (Deadly)|Wrath of Hell]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] improves his health, attack rate and movement speed.

